# The build context of every image built from the repository root. Nothing
# reaches an image unless it is admitted here: everything is excluded, then
# the directories and files the Dockerfiles copy are let back in.
*
!lib
!adapters
!catalog
!configs
!services
!build/runtime-constraints.txt
!docs/ops/configuration-grammar.md
# NodalArc's license, its additional terms, the third-party notices and the
# license texts those notices name, which every image whose label names
# AGPL-3.0-only carries. Images built from another directory reach them
# through the named context nodalarc-legal.
!LICENSE
!NOTICE
!THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
!LICENSES

# Inside the admitted directories, files that describe or build the code and
# are not needed to run it.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/README.md
**/Dockerfile
**/*.proto

# Ephemeris datasets converted on a developer machine. Each image converts its
# own at build time from the pinned sources.
configs/ephemerides/anise
